' Token ledger (GitHub token-ledger-proxy, origin/main 921fb37 = rev16 + 2026-11-21 rename) - auto-start at logon.
' Replaces the old "Strata ledger watchdog.vbs" (skills-dir chain, retired 2026-11-21).
' Starts ONLY the watchdog; the watchdog starts the ledger proxy (package dir
' C:\Work\LLM\token-ledger-proxy, its config.json owns listen 8080 / upstream 8787).
' --lock-wait 86400 = hot standby when another watchdog still holds lock 43176,
' then zero-gap takeover. Use python.exe, never pythonw.exe.
Set sh = CreateObject("WScript.Shell")
sh.CurrentDirectory = "C:\Work\LLM\token-ledger-proxy"
sh.Run """C:\Work\LLM\Strata\terminal\python\python.exe"" ""C:\Work\LLM\token-ledger-proxy\ledger_watchdog.py"" --lock-wait 86400", 0, False
